  H  -1.721300  3.467820  0.402594
  H  0.764900  2.260125  3.593114
  H  1.346541  4.890540  2.208524
  H  2.077103  5.040892  2.800166
  H  -0.983268  4.227432  3.250614
  H  -1.713829  4.077079  2.658971
  H  1.327136  3.298767  0.935141
  H  -0.963862  5.819203  4.523997
K_POINTS automatic
  2 2 2 0 0 0
CELL_PARAMETERS (angstrom)
